ecific number (20) supported by a full itemized list.\n\n## Verdict\nThe agent reached the correct customization page for the 14-inch MacBook Pro, located the Keyboard section, and the final response provides a specific, internally consistent answer to the question asked.\n\n**SUCCESS**",
